    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS DISCLAIMER</strong>: Strayed is currently in active development and is being offered as an early access title. It may contain bugs, incomplete features, and content that is subject to change. We are continuously working hard to improve the game with updates every two weeks. Your feedback is greatly appreciated as we progress toward the final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Strayed</strong> - an open-world multiplayer VR survival game focused on player vs. player interaction. Spawn empty-handed on procedurally generated islands; explore the wilderness and deserted structures; gather resources and build your shelter. Be warned - others are just as motivated as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/bd1c6d6dbde6b3abd1946552e283c936.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/bd1c6d6dbde6b3abd1946552e283c936.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped on procedurally generated islands with only a rock and a torch, you start as a \u201cNaked\u201d - literally and figuratively - eager to make it until dawn or dusk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/80297598b3d8e60a003b7cdba52ec66d.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/80297598b3d8e60a003b7cdba52ec66d.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re skilled enough to fight your way off the beach, you may find yourself either in an abandoned structure - or more of the wilderness. Explore the unknown in immersive VR while you instinctively choose your next move for survival\u2019s sake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/132aa0c32ddcc3b5b4712d76cd8db207.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/132aa0c32ddcc3b5b4712d76cd8db207.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything at your disposal. Smash, gather, loot, hunt, craft, and build - all in the name of living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/c074bbef208088a75d8cd8d6890aad1e.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/c074bbef208088a75d8cd8d6890aad1e.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like it or not - you\u2019re never alone. Meet other players on the islands as you go through your survival journey. Some will be willing to make friends; some won\u2019t be. Keep in mind - you're not the only one trying to survive.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS DISCLAIMER</strong>: Strayed is currently in active development and is being offered as an early access title. It may contain bugs, incomplete features, and content that is subject to change. We are continuously working hard to improve the game with updates every two weeks. Your feedback is greatly appreciated as we progress toward the final product.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Strayed</strong> - an open-world multiplayer VR survival game focused on player vs. player interaction. Spawn empty-handed on procedurally generated islands; explore the wilderness and deserted structures; gather resources and build your shelter. Be warned - others are just as motivated as you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/bd1c6d6dbde6b3abd1946552e283c936.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/bd1c6d6dbde6b3abd1946552e283c936.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped on procedurally generated islands with only a rock and a torch, you start as a \u201cNaked\u201d - literally and figuratively - eager to make it until dawn or dusk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/80297598b3d8e60a003b7cdba52ec66d.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/80297598b3d8e60a003b7cdba52ec66d.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re skilled enough to fight your way off the beach, you may find yourself either in an abandoned structure - or more of the wilderness. Explore the unknown in immersive VR while you instinctively choose your next move for survival\u2019s sake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/132aa0c32ddcc3b5b4712d76cd8db207.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/132aa0c32ddcc3b5b4712d76cd8db207.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything at your disposal. Smash, gather, loot, hunt, craft, and build - all in the name of living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/c074bbef208088a75d8cd8d6890aad1e.poster.avif?t=1741385957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359470/extras/c074bbef208088a75d8cd8d6890aad1e.webm?t=1741385957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you like it or not - you\u2019re never alone. Meet other players on the islands as you go through your survival journey. Some will be willing to make friends; some won\u2019t be. Keep in mind - you're not the only one trying to survive.</p>",
